  "narrative": {
    "intro": "The Top government contractors, FY2027 to date ranking shows how contract obligations are distributed so far in the fiscal year. The total obligations across ranked contractors equal $11.3B. The rankings list the largest obligated contractors by name and dollar value. TRIWEST HEALTHCARE ALLIANCE CORP leads the list with obligations of $900M, followed by TRIAD NATIONAL SECURITY, LLC with $875M and NATIONAL TECHNOLOGY & ENGINEERING SOLUTIONS OF SANDIA, LLC with $633M. The full top ten also includes LAWRENCE LIVERMORE NATIONAL SECURITY, LLC at $550M; CONSOLIDATED NUCLEAR SECURITY, LLC at $489M; SAVANNAH RIVER NUCLEAR SOLUTIONS LLC at $379M; FLUOR MARINE PROPULSION, LLC at $373M; ACCENTURE FEDERAL SERVICES LLC at $338M; HONEYWELL FEDERAL MANUFACTURING & TECHNOLOGIES, LLC at $323M; and UT-BATTELLE LLC at $302M. All figures are contract obligations. Current-year totals are partial because the period is FY2027 to date.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "Who are the top contractors by obligations in FY2027 to date?",
        "body": "TRIWEST HEALTHCARE ALLIANCE CORP is the top contractor with obligations of $900M. TRIAD NATIONAL SECURITY, LLC follows with $875M and NATIONAL TECHNOLOGY & ENGINEERING SOLUTIONS OF SANDIA, LLC is third with $633M. The remainder of the top ten ranges from LAWRENCE LIVERMORE NATIONAL SECURITY, LLC at $550M down to UT-BATTELLE LLC at $302M."
      },
      {
        "heading": "How does the FY2027 to date total relate to the top contractors?",
        "body": "The ranked contractors account for obligations within a total of $11.3B for FY2027 to date. The top ten list shows individual obligations that sum into that total across the fiscal year to date. All figures are contract obligations and current-year totals are partial."
      }
    ]
  },
